{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act44side_level_act44side_04_beg","storyGroup":"act44side","storySort":8,"storyDependence":"act44side_level_act44side_03_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"AT-4","storyName":"百物语","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"由于萌萌香在拍节目时无意拾起的一截断刀，三船下令追捕萌萌香。澪试图为她求情，但三船的手下还是追到了神社外面。在那位沉稳神职的掩护下，星熊和萌萌香成功逃脱。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act44side/level_act44side_04_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act44side_04","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":6,"next":8,"characters":["澪","三船","沉稳的神职","好事的神明","星熊","懒散的神明","萌萌香","记者的声音","摄像师的声音"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_bg_64_g6_gokudouoffice.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loading_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_sys_loading_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#13$1","duration":"1","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#13$1","focus":"r","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"三船先生。","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"交待你办的事怎么样了？","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#13$1","focus":"r","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"议员大人终于首肯金石集团和金石会的剥离了。","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"只要您现在接过会长的位置，金石会就可以和金石集团彻底分离。","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"呵，那不如就把继位仪式和明晚的花火大会同时办了，你觉得怎么样？","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"铁斋那边的态度没变，现在甚至多了星熊作为助力，我们真的能在一天之内……","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"能。","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"你眉头微微跳了一下。我知道你在想什么。你知道我不在这种事上开玩笑，又对我没信心。归根结底……","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"觉得我没必要让你仿老东西的笔迹，把星熊叫回来徒增麻烦，是不是？","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"……","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8c/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"二十多年前，星熊手里那面盾引发了不少血雨腥风。毕竟是老东西的最后一作……澪，你去过他家吗？","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#13$1","focus":"r","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"好多年前了。","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"他家最多的是什么？","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#13$1","focus":"r","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"电视。","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"对，电视。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"老家伙迂腐不假，但他的嗅觉偶尔也很灵敏。","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"他知道金石会如果永远那么打打杀杀下去，总有一天会彻底完蛋。所以，他盯上了源石晶体元件。","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"触类旁通，他家打金属的工坊很快变成了制作晶体元件的作坊，然后一炮打响。这下老家伙没工夫打他最喜欢的神兵利器了。","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"就在晶体产业蒸蒸日上的时候，老家伙忽然从光元一系的破落公家那里淘到了铸盾的材料和工艺。","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"据说为了那些材料和工艺，他用了组里当时将近一半的流动资金。","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"你觉得，对当时的金石会来说，一面这么大来头，而且几乎可以肯定是他最后一作的盾，意味着什么？","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#13$1","focus":"r","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"……传位。","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"连你都知道的事，老家伙却给搁下了。他就那么拖着，拖着，一直拖到南院的第一届议会都要开选了。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"对你们这辈人来说，你们早都习惯议会这东西了。可对当时的我们来说，没人知道那是什么。","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"一开始我们以为他们是要改官制，但那是他们几年后才做的事。","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"我们那时只听说，“议员”是要从平民中选的。这下整个南院都轰动了起来……然后，那个姓惟任的倒霉蛋就跳了出来。","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#13$1","focus":"r","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"……那位议员候选人？","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"是啊。他当时的政见一大堆，核心却是要把我们金石会从锻冶町赶出去。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"他甚至纠结了一帮乌合之众，每天在我们锻冶町外面吵吵嚷嚷，让我们做不成生意。","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"老东西——不，不光老东西，整个金石会一开始没把他当回事，直到他的人越来越多，越来越多。","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"所以……您决定除掉他。","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"是啊。后面的事，你也都知道了。那个议员候选人死了之后，金石会才领教了什么叫做民意汹汹。","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"也是在那之后，我才明白，尽管在四大家族面前，议员只是拿来装点门面的花瓶……","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"但对我们这些人而言，议员的一句话，一点头，往往就能决定我们的生和死。","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"……恕我直言，您其实可以直接告诉我，如果铁斋会长不从，您在继位仪式上需要般若。","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"我真得说，你有时候还挺像铁斋的。","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"当然，铁斋骑在我头上是一回事，像你这样忠心耿耿、知无不言，那又是另一回事。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"说真的，金石集团和金石会剥离之后，我自然不能再当这个金石会的会长。除了你，会里还有第二个能接我班的人吗？","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#13$1","focus":"r","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"……","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"等我进入政界，有了自己的一方势力的那一天，自然也不会亏待你和你的金石会的。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":78},{"type":"text","text":"三船自顾自地大笑起来。","id":79},{"type":"text","text":"而他眼前的女性仍然面无表情，不知道她究竟是习惯了如此，是不敢相信自己听见了什么，还是对远大的未来无动于衷。","id":80},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"至于现在，我们的第一要务，仍然是萌萌香。","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"她实在知道太多东西了，而且还和那个情报贩子搭上了线。","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"她为了把佐野口的断刀留在身上，甚至不惜跳窗逃跑，这意味着什么，你还不明白吗？","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"三船先生——","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"你不忍心，而且愿意对我说，这很好。我也可以答应你，让她得矿石病的事可以再考虑考虑。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"但是，首先，你得把她给我抓回来。","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"她手里的断刀，上面的刀镡无论如何都要回收。","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"其次，她这个艺人无论如何不可能再当下去。她未来必须处在我们的严密掌控之下。","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"这样你满意了吗？","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1901_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"澪","text":"多谢您的宽宏大量。","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c3/Avg_avg_npc_1901_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"等你把她抓来，还是让她谢谢你吧。","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":99},{"type":"dialog","id":100},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":101},{"type":"charslot","id":102},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":103},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_bg_64_g7_jinja_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":104},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":105},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":106},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":107,"musicid":1},{"type":"text","text":"太阳缓缓爬上头顶。","id":108},{"type":"text","text":"尽管没有其他访客，但庭园中有了四个人和一个神明的身影，也就不再显得那么空旷安静。","id":109},{"type":"text","text":"吉星拿出身上能写字的一切让萌萌香签名，萌萌香被猛烈的攻势吓了一跳，但签名的手速一点也不慢。","id":110},{"type":"text","text":"庭院另一边，宫司怀里抱着刚刚那位左冲右突的神明，正和星熊说着什么。","id":111},{"type":"dialog","id":112},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1902_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":113},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的神职","text":"刚刚毕竟也是神明大人要与人游戏，我作为神职，自然也只能旁观，不好插手，还请星熊小姐见谅。","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_npc_1902_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":116},{"type":"charslot","id":117},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_monocycle_bell","id":118},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","duration":"1","id":119},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"你自己不也看得挺开心？","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1902_1#1$1","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的神职","text":"有吗？","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_npc_1902_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"我觉得有。","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1902_1#12$1","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的神职","text":"诚心诚意侍奉神明，自然会让人心情愉悦。星熊小姐和萌萌香小姐刚刚不也一样？","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1902_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"我还是更关心祂为什么半夜闯入我家。","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"什么叫“半夜闯入”，说得我好像什么危险分子似的。突然有人在凶宅里收垃圾倒垃圾，还躺在那里睡觉，换做是你，不会觉得奇怪吗？","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"就因为是凶宅？御机发生的命案那么多，锻冶町更不是什么太平的地方，为什么你偏偏去窥探我家？","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"因为怪谈啊。","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"……你和怪谈到底有没有关系？","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"“跟事件一同出现”和“引发怪谈的元凶”完完全全就是两码事，好不好？","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"要是我自己就能引发怪谈，那我还辛辛苦苦地骑着独轮车到处跑做什么？","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"也就是说，你完全就是个凑热闹的家伙，却被人误当成了引发怪谈的怪谈？","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"还行，你理解力不错。","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"我跟你说，当神明是件看天吃饭的事情。","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"这里号称是结缘的神社，按说大多数人这辈子都在和人打交道，应该没什么比人和人之间的“缘分”更重要了，对不对？","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"时局稳定，人们就祈求现有的缘分长长久久，时局不稳，人们就祈求缘分帮自己渡过难关，或是结些新的缘分。","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"可近十几年，来这儿的人越来越少，越来越少，少到现在，一天能有十几个人来就了不起了。","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"神职大人，这是真的吗？","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1902_1#1$1","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的神职","text":"略有夸张，不过近年这里人气不旺，也的确是事实。","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_npc_1902_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"有些神纯粹就是懒鬼，越没人来越高兴。我就不一样了，没点事情发生，我都要无聊死了好吗——","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":155},{"type":"charslot","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1905_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":157},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":158},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"看，懒鬼来了。","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"懒鬼？","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"对啊，已经走到你脚边了。","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":165},{"type":"text","text":"星熊看向自己脚下，但那里除了神社的石质地面以外什么都没有。","id":166},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"喂，我们神社的招牌，给客人看看不行吗？","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1905_1#1$1","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"懒散的神明","text":"……","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_avg_npc_1905_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":171},{"type":"text","text":"星熊伸手去脚边摸索。","id":172},{"type":"text","text":"在神职的眼中，她的手已经与那位神明的身躯重合，但星熊仍然觉得自己什么都没有摸到。","id":173},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"我们神社之所以会传出结缘的名声，就是因为这家伙。凡是他觉得最近在结缘上有好事发生的人，他就愿意在人家面前现形。","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"要是他觉得你最近没什么缘分，甚至是有什么缘分要断绝，就坚决不现身。","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"我都这么说了，他还不愿意在你面前现身，看来你最近有缘分要断啦。","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"……","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1902_1#1$1","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的神职","text":"事在人为。这样的一面之词，星熊小姐倒也不必全信。","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_npc_1902_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"你怎么还拆自家神明的台？","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"总而言之，人无聊了就会追求些有的没的，神也一样。","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"正巧你消失之后，御机就开始怪谈频发，我为了消闲解闷去追一追怪谈也没什么不对的吧？","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":186},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#5$1","id":187},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":188},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"怎么不说话了？害怕自己最近要断缘分了？","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"那倒不是，只是没想到，连神明也会追逐这种虚无缥缈的事情。","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"你这家伙！","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"不管怎么说，你不是森内要找的神明。","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"当然不是。","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"不过，能否请你和我们走一趟？口说无凭，假如你能在他面前像跟我和萌萌香这样聊上几句……","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"宫司大人，帮帮忙，这个鬼要把你家的神明捉走欸！","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1902_1#12$1","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的神职","text":"这些年我也受了森内君不少恩惠，至少关东煮一直没断过。","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1902_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"嘁。","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"算了，本神明心胸宽广，走一趟就走一趟。","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":208},{"type":"charslot","id":209},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.7","id":210},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#3$1","duration":"1","id":211},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"星熊，你和宫司大人聊好了吗？","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"差不多了。吉星呢？","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#2$1","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"她还得回去看店，就先走啦。","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"这小姑娘也去？","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#11$1","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"是啊。加上一位怪谈缠身的萌萌香相伴，这样总算是能请动你了吧。","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"我都说了跟你走，有谁相伴很重要吗？","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":224},{"type":"text","text":"话虽如此，神明仍然把独轮车骑到萌萌香身边，左嗅嗅右探探，一副饶有兴趣的样子。","id":225},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"小姑娘，你的节目我可没少看。你是不是什么受诅咒的体质？","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#7$1","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"这、这我哪知道啊！","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"我其实很怕怪谈的，我其实很希望以后身边平平安安，再也不发生什么怪事。","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"嚯，你就不好奇吗？","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#6$1","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"我其实只想把演艺事业干好。","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#20$1","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"虽然怪谈相关的东西确实帮我涨了不少人气，但我觉得……这样其实不太……光明正大。","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"艺人就应该靠自己的努力给大家带去快乐，这才是正道。","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"现在像你这么想的人倒也不多见了。你还怪有趣的。","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#10$1","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"对、对了，我正想问您呢！昨天晚上，我家发生了很可怕的事情！","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a1/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#18$1","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"我家的电视突然开始自己播放我唱歌的剪辑，还把剪辑和电视台的警报放在了一起……","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"最后，还不知为什么……放了一段很可怕的视频……","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"啧啧啧！视频内容是什么？不明生物？血案现场？","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#20$1","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"都不是，是澪小姐……没过多久，她真的来了我家……","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"那不就是电视线路出问题了？我要找的怪谈不是这种。","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"不是这种？","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"你既然追逐怪谈，不就该相信怪谈都是人类所为吗？","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"你这人真不解风情。如果都是人类搞的鬼，那我追个什么劲？","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"所谓怪谈，就是无论如何都找不到原因的事件。","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"人类找不到事件的原因，像森内那样的家伙，就怪到我们神明头上。","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"而连神明都不知道原因的事件，那当然是因为有更加强大，更加神秘莫测，更加让我兴奋的东西，在我们背后捣乱啊。","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"可独轮车确实是你骑的吧。","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"咳，一件小事而已，别打岔！","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"……这么说，你也在追逐神明了？追逐“神明”头上的“神明”？","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"正是如此！","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":267},{"type":"charslot","id":268},{"type":"playsound","key":"$phonevibration","id":269},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":270},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#3$1","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"是吉星？","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"你们交换了终端号码？","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#2$1","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"嗯。事务所很少给我和粉丝直接交流的机会，她又那么热情。","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":277},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":278},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#2$1","id":279},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"喂？吉星？","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#7$1","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"什么？","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":284,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#8$1","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"什么？！","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"这不是真的！我没有这个意思——这不是我的意思！","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"是的！我从来没有说过要隐退！","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#1$1","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"嗯，嗯。","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#18$1","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"……不多聊了？可能有人一直在跟着你？！","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#20$1","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"好的！我这就……","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#13$1","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"连神社也？","id":297,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#12$1","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"好的，我立刻告诉大家！你千万小心！","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":300},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_ringoff","id":301},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":302},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"有人放出你要隐退的消息？","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#20$1","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"吉星说论坛上面传得很厉害，不像是随便哪个人瞎说的，像是金石台放的风……","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"吉星又是怎么回事？","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#13$1","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"有金石会的人跟踪她。她还说神社周围可能也不安全，她出神门的时候看见有人在附近鬼鬼祟祟的了。","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1902_1#2$1","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的神职","text":"下次见到吉星的时候，帮我向她道个谢。","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1902_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的神职","text":"不过倒也不必太过担心。哪怕是横行御机的黑道，若是敢滋扰神社境内，也只不过是自讨苦吃。","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1902_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的神职","text":"如果各位需要在神社境内暂避，可以进入室内，其余事情由我应对。如果各位要离开，也可以按我指示走小路离开。","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1902_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#7$1","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"我们还是赶快回去比较好。我们晚走一刻，他能在附近布下的人也就越多。","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"萌萌香，骑车就拜托你了。","id":317,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#13$1","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"好的！骑了一整夜的车，我觉得自己现在多少也有些心得了！","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"那，宫司大人，我们就先走了。","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"那我跟你们走，是不是也能被那些黑道啊什么的追着跑？","id":323,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"我们会尽量不惹人注意——","id":325,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"那风头就都由我来出咯？","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"出风头是说——","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#3$1","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"是要帮我们引开黑道，对不对？","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1904_1#1$2","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"从结果上讲是这样没错啦。偶尔戏耍戏耍那些呆头呆脑的黑道，虽然比不上追逐怪谈，但也算是消遣。","id":333,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的神明","text":"我先从正门冲出去，吸引一下那些呆头黑道的注意力，你们趁机从后面撤，在森内那个笨蛋的摊子集合！","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_1904_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":335},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_monocycle_fast_lp","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0.6","id":336},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2.5","id":337},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"350,0","duration":"1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":338},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":339},{"type":"charslot","id":340},{"type":"text","text":"没给任何人应答的时间，独轮车便风驰电掣地驶向神门之外，脚蹬飞转到大白天都只能看见残影。","id":341},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1902_1#1$1","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的神职","text":"看来神明很中意你们啊。","id":343,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_npc_1902_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#2$1","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"嘿嘿……","id":345,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1902_1#2$1","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的神职","text":"不过现在不是感叹的时候了。两位请走这边，我来给你们带路。","id":347,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1902_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":348},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":349},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":350},{"type":"charslot","id":351},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":352},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":353},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#20$1","duration":"0.5","id":354},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"好难找的小路……","id":356,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1902_1#2$1","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的神职","text":"话虽如此，也不敢说没有人会发现这里。二位赶快离开吧。","id":358,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1902_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"多谢宫司大人鼎力相助。","id":360,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1902_1#1$1","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的神职","text":"这是哪里的话——","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_npc_1902_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":363},{"type":"dialog","id":364},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crowdrun","volume":"0.6","id":365},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":366},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"记者的声音","text":"这边有响动！摄像师，快来快来，我觉得这边可能有人！","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄像师的声音","text":"这片地也算是神社境内了，我们这么直接闯进来，是不是……","id":369},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"记者的声音","text":"三船先生的命令要紧，还是神社的破规矩要紧？赶快过来！","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"记者的声音","text":"不用像那些混混似的喊打喊杀，拿着话筒和摄像机就能混饭吃，还有比这更美的差事吗？过来！","id":372},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1902_1#2$1","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的神职","text":"……","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1902_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#20$1","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"宫司大人，现、现在怎么办？","id":376,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1902_1#2$1","id":377},{"type":"text","text":"神职闭口不言，脸上愉快随和，偶尔甚至有些自得其乐的神色已然消失不见。","id":378},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":379},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1902_1#2$1","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的神职","text":"两位暂且在这里稍等一下。","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1902_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#10$1","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"您……要出手了？","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a1/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1902_1#2$1","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的神职","text":"不过是例行公事，祓除些许邪秽罢了。","id":385,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1902_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":386},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_windchime_JP","volume":"0.7","id":387},{"type":"text","text":"宫司站定在原地，御币随手一挥，风铃停摆，树叶微颤。空气骤然变得稀薄而澄净。","id":388},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_faceoff_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":389,"musicid":3},{"type":"dialog","id":390},{"type":"backgroundtween","xScaleFrom":"1","yScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.05","yScaleTo":"1.05","duration":"1.9","id":391},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_bg_64_g7_jinja_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"1.5","id":392},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_OriginiumArts_llfather","id":393},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_OriginiumArts_llfather_lp","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":394},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":395},{"type":"text","text":"晶莹的火自宽袍大袖间喷涌而出，像是凝固的清泉，并不奔腾，甚至没有摇动，只是静谧地漂浮在空中，直至风声自神门的方向传来。","id":396},{"type":"text","text":"那是神明与人游戏时决不会掀起的，锐利如刀刃的恶风。","id":397},{"type":"text","text":"望见后院处燃起的渺远狐火，神门处的神明松开车把立起身，带着一丝得意地扬起前爪，向空中一挥——","id":398},{"type":"dialog","id":399},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_firecut","volume":"1","id":400},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"50","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":401},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.4","r":"0.5","g":"0.5","b":"0.8","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":402},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.1","r":"0.5","g":"0.5","b":"0.8","fadetime":"1.25","block":"false","id":403},{"type":"text","text":"晶莹的火焰宛如驱邪的雷一般炸开，围绕整个神社的注连绳瞬间燃起狐火，将现世与神域分隔。","id":404},{"type":"text","text":"而酷烈的风在神域外围爆发开去，窃听器、无人机、摄像头，覆盖在上面的伪装全数被掀开，连机器本身也被吹到半空之中。","id":405},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄像师的声音","text":"好大的风——设备，设备怎么飞起来了？！","id":407},{"type":"playsound","key":"$firestorm","volume":"1","id":408},{"type":"text","text":"御币划破风的中轴，围绕着神域肆意生长的狐火倏地分裂开来。风剥开那些设备的外壳，而火精准地穿过裸露出来的每一组核心。","id":409},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":410},{"type":"text","text":"被击中的设备内部燃起绚丽却无声的白焰，一瞬之后，又纷纷炸裂、焦黑、炭化。","id":411},{"type":"dialog","id":412},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1918_1#10$1","duration":"0.5","id":413},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萌萌香","text":"宫司大人……难道是个隐藏的源石技艺大师？","id":415,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a1/Avg_avg_npc_1918_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1902_1#1$1","id":416},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的神职","text":"一点小法术罢了，不足为奇。","id":417,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_npc_1902_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的神职","text":"时间正好。趁这个机会，两位赶快出发吧。","id":418,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_npc_1902_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":419},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":420},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":421},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":422},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":423},{"type":"image","id":424},{"type":"charslot","id":425}],"characters":["澪","三船","沉稳的神职","好事的神明","星熊","懒散的神明","萌萌香","记者的声音","摄像师的声音"]}